  "solution": "**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8b70f1bf32b2ff4180d1583ab4bc7fade7f64d6e233d0f4a91cb0627ff31ae6d.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(3+8× 8÷8 of 8+7÷ 7× 2)/(5÷ 5 of 4+3× 3÷3-3+2)\n\n⇒ (3 + 8 × 8 ÷ 64 + 7 ÷ 7 × 2)/(5 ÷ 20 + 3 × 3 ÷ 3 - 3 + 2)\n\n⇒ (3 + 8 × (1/8) + 1 × 2)/((1/4) + 3 × 1 - 3 + 2)\n\n⇒ (3 + 1 + 2)/((1/4) + 2)\n\n⇒ (6× 4)/(1 + 8)\n\n⇒ 24/9\n\n⇒ 8/3 = 2(2)/(3)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 2(2)/(3).**\n\n132:T",
